  "goodToKnow": "Die Begrenzung is a limit or restriction: die Begrenzung der Mieten, die Begrenzung der Erderwärmung. Die Geschwindigkeitsbegrenzung is a speed limit, and large stretches of the German Autobahn famously have none, only a recommended speed of 130 km/h; whether to introduce a Tempolimit is a long-running debate. Begrenzen means to limit, and begrenzt means limited: nur begrenzt verfügbar. From die Grenze (border, limit)."
